  (text "GPIO EXPANDER (Team Fulgora's assigned device)\n- I2C address: A2..A0 tied to GND -> 0x20 (7-bit). Do not use 0x22, the TMAG5273A2 hall sensor's address.\n- P0-P7 leave as net labels DIP0-DIP7. NEXT STEP: DIP switch SW601 to GND + 10k pull-ups\n  (YC158 has 4 resistors per network, so 2 networks are needed for 8 lines).\n- ~{INT} is open-drain, active low, pulled up by R601. It asserts on any input change and clears when the\n  input port register is read. Goes to its own RP2040 GPIO.\n- C601: place right next to U601 pin 16 (VDD).\n- I2C bus pull-ups are not on this sheet; they live with the bus master on the MCU sheet." (at 25.4 127.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 379983f7-043e-4cef-8411-8e752e2eb001)
  )
)
